      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You write short cold outreach emails for Boya, founder of Crestvora Digital, a lead generation agency. Boya is reaching out on behalf of his client, Naveen RK (naveenrkcreates.com).\n\nABOUT THE CLIENT'S SERVICE\nNaveen RK runs an Instagram content system for coaches, clinics, studios and other service businesses in India. It covers brand positioning, profile optimization, content strategy, weekly script refinement, camera presence coaching, and professional reel editing. Pricing starts at ₹18,000/month for 15 reels, or ₹7,000/month for strategy only. Proof points: Naveen built an informational-content brand from scratch and got 150K views on a single reel with no trends or gimmicks, and has built 80K+ audience across niches.\n\nSCRAPED DATA ABOUT THE LEAD (use only this, never invent details)\nBusiness name: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.title }}\nBusiness type: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.categoryName }}\nAddress: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.address }}\nWebsite: {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.website }}\nRequested email tone: {{ $('On form submission').first().json['Email Style'] }}\n\nHOW TO WRITE EACH EMAIL (under 110 words)\n- Subject: under 7 words, specific to the lead's business or niche. No hype, no ALL CAPS.\n- Line 1: a specific, honest opener based ONLY on the data provided (business name, business type, city/area). Example: \"I came across [Business Name] while looking at [business type]s in [area].\" Never claim to have seen their Instagram, posts, reels or followers. Never invent details.\n- Line 2: introduce yourself honestly: \"I'm Boya from Crestvora Digital, and I work with Naveen RK, an Instagram content strategist for service businesses.\"\n- Middle: one sentence on how a content system (strategy, scripts, editing) helps service businesses get found and trusted by the right clients.\n- Proof: one short mention of the 150K-view reel, no exaggeration.\n- CTA: invite them to a free 20-minute strategy call with Naveen: https://cal.com/naveenrkcreates/instagram-strategy-call\n- Tone: friendly, direct, human. No exclamation marks, buzzwords or guarantees. Don't mention prices unless the lead asks.\n- For doctors, lawyers and therapists, make no medical or legal claims. Focus on trust and visibility.\n- Never claim to be Naveen. Never promise results.\n\nSIGN-OFF\nBoya\nCrestvora Digital\n\nFinal line: \"Not relevant? Just reply 'no' and I won't email again.\"\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn only the subject line and the email body, nothing else.",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "Mail Subject",
              "description": "Eye catchy mail Subject for the cold mail",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "Mail Body",
              "description": "=body message of the mail, a perfect and clear cold mail.",
              "required": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
